  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 08/21 - Taking account of a bidder's approach to payment in the procurement of major government contracts",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0821",
  "description": "This Procurement Policy Note (PPN) and guidance documents are now out of date and have been replaced by PPN 10/23.",
